---
import "../styles/landingpage/style.scss"
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8" />
		<meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
		<title>Yanwenyuan.uk</title>
		<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/icon.png" />
	</head>

	<body>
		<div class="hero">
			<div class="hero-inner">
				<div class="hero-scroll">
					<img src="/ywy-full-compressed.svg" alt="燕文院" class="hero-logo" />
				<p class="hero-title">YANWENYUAN</p>
				</div>
				<div class="hero-prose">
					<p>山上燕文院，閑書收集之處。陋頁存敝人燕某之作，亦收他書，再通友院。</p>
					<p>Works by or collected by Yan. Most pages are in Chinese or Classical Chinese.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="landing-band"></div>

		<div class="cbox">
			<h2>
				<div class="icon-badge">
					<span class="title-icons icon-make" aria-hidden="true"></span>
				</div>
				Creations
			</h2>
			<ul>
			    <li><a href="https://art.yanwenyuan.uk">燕文畵舘：Artworks Site</a> (external subsite)</li>
				<li><a href="baoyu/">暴雨中：In Torrential Rains</a> (一篇玄幻故事；进行中)</li>
				<li><a href="shenhai/">神海大作集：Collections from the Celestial Sea</a>（竖排繁体文言短篇小说）</li>
			</ul>

			<hr class="section-divider" />

			<h2>
				<div class="icon-badge">
					<span class="title-icons icon-translate" aria-hidden="true"></span>
				</div>
				Translations
			</h2>
			<ul>
				<li><a href="dagengren/">大奉打更人：The Nightwatchers of Feng by 卖报小郞君</a> (ongoing, English translation)</li>
			</ul>

			<hr class="section-divider" />

			<h2>
				<div class="icon-badge">
					<span class="title-icons icon-book" aria-hidden="true"></span>
				</div>
				随意收罗的书籍
			</h2>
			<ul>
				<li><a href="fengshen/">封神演义【明】许仲林</a>（简）</li>
				<li><a href="shiji/">史記三家注【漢】司馬遷</a></li>
				<li><a href="shishuo/">師說【唐】韓愈</a></li>
				<li><a href="jimengyaojue/">擊蒙要訣【清】李珥；自《栗谷先生全書》</a></li>
				<li><a href="/zhuangzijishi/">莊子集釋【清】郭慶藩（特殊排版）</a></li>
			</ul>

			<hr class="section-divider" />

			<h2>
				<div class="icon-badge">
					<span class="title-icons icon-friend" aria-hidden="true"></span>
				</div>
				友院
			</h2>
			<ul>
				<li><a href="https://vistudium.top/">遠見齋</a> Hulenkius</li>
			</ul>

			<footer>
				<hr class="section-divider" />
				<p class="small">This website is made in Astro. Designed by Yanwenyuan.</p>
			</footer>
		</div>
	</body>
</html>
